<title>USA: Goodyear CEO backs $4.31-$4.40 FY96EPS vs$4.02.</title>
<headline>Goodyear CEO backs $4.31-$4.40 FY96EPS vs$4.02.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goodyear Tire &amp; Rubber Co chief executive officer Samir Gibara said Monday he is comfortable with First Call's range of analysts' earnings estimates for 1996 of $4.31-$4.40 a share versus 1995's $4.02.</p>
<p>Asked about the First Call range, he said, &quot;I'm comfortable with it.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Cleveland Newsdesk, Susan Zimmerman 216-579-0077</p>
</text>
